        "spans_beyond_this_verse": false,
        "text": "Readers are referred to the verse 3-18-20 where Rama asks Lakshmana to deface Shuurpa-nakha who carries out the act of cutting the nose and ears of this demoness, which is the turning point of the story. From this verse it is clear that Rama is instrumental in the disfiguring of Shuurpa-nakha."
